{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"“整数环的 pro-有限完备化”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"整数环的pro-有限完备化"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p>整数环的 pro-有限完备化 $\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}$ 的定义为\n$$\r\n\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}} =\\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/n\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}$ 作为环同构于所有 $p$-进整数环的乘积:\n$$\r\n\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}\\simeq \\prod_{p}\\mathbb{Z}_p\r\n$$</p>\n"}}